  <jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row11Member">無(注3)</jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
